==Serbo-Croatian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|sh|uza}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}} {{m|sla-pro|*vъz-}} ({{etyl|ru|-}} {{m|ru|воз-}}, {{etyl|pl|-}} {{m|pl|wz-}}). Cognate with {{etyl|lt|-}} {{m|lt|už}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{qualifier|unaccented}} {{IPA|/uz/|lang=sh}}

===Preposition===
{{sh-preposition|r|уз}}

# {{lb|sh|with accusative}} [[up]], [[upward]]
#: {{usex|ići uz stepenice|t=to go upstairs|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|uz brdo|t=uphill|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|uz r(ij)eku|t=upriver|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|peti/penjati se uz konopac|t=to climb a rope|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|with accusative}} [[next]] to, [[beside]], [[by]]
#: {{usex|uz cestu|t=next to the road|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|uza samu granicu|t=on the very border|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|with accusative}} [[with]], [[along]] with (circumstances or conditions accompanying the action)
#: {{usex|uz sm(ij)eh/plač|t=while laughing/crying|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|uz p(j)esmu|t=while singing|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|uz piće|t=while drinking, while having a drink|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|p(j)evati uz klavir|t=to sing while the piano is playing|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|with accusative}} [[in spite of]], [[despite]] (={{m|sh|pȍred}})
#: {{usex|uza sve to|t=despite all that|lang=sh|inline=1}}

====Usage notes====
The variant form {{term|uza|lang=sh}} is used before enclitics and consonants which would make it difficult to pronounce.

====Related terms====
* {{l|sh|uz-}}

